SUMMARY:Craft and Create: Open Lab
DESCRIPTION:\n\nExplore endless creative possibilities in the Open Lab! Bring your own project or try one of ours\, including:\n\n\n	Buttons\, bracelets or Perler bead designs\n	Embroidery\, cross-stitch\, knitting\, crocheting or visible mending\n	Junk journaling\, scrapbooking or paper quilling\n	Painting\, dot painting\, rock painting\, adult coloring or book bedazzling\n	Cricut Maker 4 projects\n\n\nYou may also bring your own supplies to use the Cricut AutoPress or Mug Press. With hands-on activities for every maker\, stop by and get creative!\n\nStay after Open Lab to join us for Craft and Create: Custom Wooden Planter With Cricut from 5-7 p.m.\n\n
LOCATION:Lake Jackson Branch Library
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-15236-17558926
URL:https://leoncountyfl.libcal.com/event/17558926
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261015T200000Z
DTEND:20261015T210000Z
