SUMMARY:Community Music Jam
DESCRIPTION:On the third Thursday of every month\, the Jane G. Sauls Ft. Braden Branch Library will be hosting our Community Music Jam for all local musicians and enjoyers of music. Binders holding chord books for different instruments\, as well as songs with chords and lyrics\, will be provided.\n\nThis event is open to all ages to attend whether performing or listening.\n\nAll music is welcome! Only rules: no amplifiers allowed (acoustic only) and no profanity or derogatory lyrics.\n\nCurrent Song List\, Lyrics\, and Chords: Community Music Jam\n
LOCATION:Jane G. Sauls Fort Braden Branch Library
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-15236-10233849
URL:https://leoncountyfl.libcal.com/calendar/events/MusicJam
END:VEVENT
