SUMMARY:Science Night With MagLab
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a free\, fun\, and family-friendly science event for all ages\, especially great for kids ages 5-10. Each session features an exciting science topic with hands-on experiments or demonstrations\, a Q&A with a guest expert\, and an activity using simple household items.\n\nThe program lasts about 45 minutes. Plus\, library staff will recommend books and other library materials related to each Science Night topic so you can keep the learning going at home.
LOCATION:Leon County Main Library
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-15236-17324557
URL:https://leoncountyfl.libcal.com/event/17324557
END:VEVENT
